patricia
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.000
OMI.Patricia in omi-types (02808f4; boxedPINE 59c9485), patricia-paths in global.vtt. A Patricia trie of word literals on the kernel's bits: a word is a list of Byte, coded I and its eight bits for each byte and O at the end, so no code begins another (A, AN and AND are three keys); the trie branches only where two codes first differ, O to the left. insert, fromList, lookup, keys, path, sameShape. Checked (cabal build all, cabal test all, ghc -fno-code app/Main.hs): nine words (YAHWEH A AND YHWH AN ADONAI YAH ANT B) come out in byte order, a shorter word before the longer it begins; each reads back its value and ANTS, Y, YAHW and the empty word read nothing; every order of six of them (720) makes one shape; YAH and YAHWEH share their path to the fork where YAH ends (0) and YAHWEH goes on (1); adding YAG changes YAH's path and leaves AND's. Falsifier: another set of words makes another shape (inverted, the suite fails). Next: the cues as keys and values, each caption word of the Dewey classes with the classes it is in, and its WordNet lexicographer files, written by a Plan 9 C index and read into the trie.

